# The Hayes St locals on their own (the player pushes past the start line, which starts the race,
# then drags the foot brake and rolls on far behind them, falling to the wobbles on the way): each
# keeps to a lane of the route's start and gates (bomb.gateStep, at most bomb.gateLane, 1.5 m, off its
# middle), so none drifts into the parking lane any more; on this seed the Painted Ladies landlord
# (17.5 m/s, showing off out of the tuck) keeps his stand-up and wins in 57.78 s, the Hayes Valley
# barista is second in 60.53, the Alamo Square tour guide third in 65.31 (57.82 and 60.49 before the
# squeezed city; city phase 11). (Following the gates
# themselves, one a block ahead, the guide drifted 3-4 m north of the middle between Steiner and
# Fillmore, into the parking lane, where the cars now stand.)
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run bomb hayes
hold up 10..300
hold down 300..1200
run 8600
expect event bombStart{route=hayes} within 265..269
expect event racerFinish{route=hayes,name=Painted Ladies landlord,place=1,time=57.78} within 7195..7203
expect event racerFinish{route=hayes,name=Hayes Valley barista on a break,place=2,time=60.53} within 7525..7533
expect event racerFinish{route=hayes,name=Alamo Square tour guide,place=3,time=65.31} within 8100..8108
expect event racerFinish count == 3
expect no event bombFinish
